desc: Reverse the order of these lines
category: ex
par: 8
hint1: Think about move commands
hint2: :global can execute a move on every line — what happens if you move each to line 0?
solution: :g/^/m0<CR>
note: :g/^/ runs on every line; m0 moves each to the top, reversing the order.
--- START ---
first
second
third
fourth
fifth
--- GOAL ---
fifth
fourth
third
second
first
--- END ---
